#: ../../source/docs/common-servo.rst:66
#: 6bd5676a81bf498bb1985037e1dae6c3
msgid "On the Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List page, ensure that the SERVOx_FUNCTION (or RCx_FUNCTION) is set to zero for the servo (i.e. :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` = 0 if the servo is connected a Pixhawks AUX OUT2)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo.rst:67
